---
description: Declare Gradle versions in build files, never in a version catalog
alwaysApply: true
---

# Gradle dependencies

Do not use a Gradle version catalog. Never create or edit `gradle/libs.versions.toml`, and never reference `libs.versions`, `libs.plugins`, or `alias(libs...)`.

Put each plugin and library version in the Gradle build file that uses it.

```kotlin
plugins {
    id("com.android.application") version "9.4.1" apply false
}

dependencies {
    implementation("com.google.mediapipe:tasks-genai:0.10.27")
}
```

An inline Compose BOM (`platform("androidx.compose:compose-bom:2026.02.01")`) is fine. A catalog file is not.
